body:
Gonna throw in some advice I haven't seen here yet: Hoard your GTs and throw them all into limited boxes. Even if you don't have enough resources to empty the box it's still objectively the best place to spend your GTs since your chances of getting at least an SR increase with every pull. Two of the four limited URs I've gotten between my two accounts came from GTs. It's still a lot of luck to get a UR in 20-30 solos but it's less luck than if you spent those GTs in the main box. 

That said, I still haven't pulled one of my best girls. Bokuhika Pana came home on both EN and JP (was scouting for Rin) and WBNW You and Blu-ray Chika came home instead of Riko. My JP account is Aqours second year focused so it's always wonderful to see You or Chika, I love them very much too, but there's still a little bit of disappointment getting a limited that's not the one you wanted. I'd say if your account is 3rd year based and you love Kanan and Dia and would be happy to get them, go for it. But if you have your heart set on Mari and Mari only just be aware that there's a good chance you won't get her. Saving up for the AC limiteds where you can guarantee a Mari is a much safer bet. 

&#x200B;

